            <body>Source: ah5-core-java-spring/serviceregistry/documentation/v5.3.0/ServiceRegistry-v5.3.0-deviceDiscovery-HTTP-IDD.tex; The service is registered in the ServiceRegistry with the interface template generic_https (generic_http when TLS is disabled), access port 8443 and base path /serviceregistry/device-discovery. The operations property of the interface lists the operations below with their method and path relative to the base path (path parameters are placeholders such as \texttt{{id}} that the consumer fills in):

\noindent\begin{longtable}{| p{5.2cm} | p{1.6cm} | p{8.4cm} |} \hline
\rowcolor{gray!33} Operation &amp; Method &amp; Path \\ \hline \endhead
register &amp; POST &amp; /register \\ \hline
lookup &amp; POST &amp; /lookup \\ \hline
revoke &amp; DELETE &amp; \texttt{/revoke/{name}} \\ \hline
\end{longtable}

\newpage</body>
