          <ownedComment xmi:id="_ah53_ea197f9d4b5d88d5b038df97" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>Source: ah5-core-java-spring/authentication/documentation/v5.3.0/Authentication-v5.3.0-identity-HTTP-IDD.tex; The service is registered in the ServiceRegistry with the interface template generic_https (generic_http when TLS is disabled), access port 8444 and base path /authentication/identity. The operations property of the interface lists the operations below with their method and path relative to the base path (path parameters are placeholders such as \texttt{{id}} that the consumer fills in):

\noindent\begin{longtable}{| p{5.2cm} | p{1.6cm} | p{8.4cm} |} \hline
\rowcolor{gray!33} Operation &amp; Method &amp; Path \\ \hline \endhead
identity-login &amp; POST &amp; /login \\ \hline
identity-logout &amp; POST &amp; /logout \\ \hline
identity-change-credentials &amp; POST &amp; /change \\ \hline
identity-verify &amp; GET &amp; \texttt{/verify/{token}} \\ \hline
\end{longtable}

\newpage</body>
          </ownedComment>
