            <body>Source: ah5-core-java-spring/authentication/documentation/v5.3.0/Authentication-v5.3.0-identityManagement-HTTP-IDD.tex; The service is registered in the ServiceRegistry with the interface template generic_https (generic_http when TLS is disabled), access port 8444 and base path /authentication/mgmt. The operations property of the interface lists the operations below with their method and path relative to the base path (path parameters are placeholders such as \texttt{{id}} that the consumer fills in):

\noindent\begin{longtable}{| p{5.2cm} | p{1.6cm} | p{8.4cm} |} \hline
\rowcolor{gray!33} Operation &amp; Method &amp; Path \\ \hline \endhead
identity-mgmt-create &amp; POST &amp; /identities \\ \hline
identity-mgmt-update &amp; PUT &amp; /identities \\ \hline
identity-mgmt-remove &amp; DELETE &amp; /identities \\ \hline
identity-mgmt-query &amp; POST &amp; /identities/query \\ \hline
identity-mgmt-session-close &amp; DELETE &amp; /sessions \\ \hline
identity-mgmt-session-query &amp; POST &amp; /sessions \\ \hline
\end{longtable}

\newpage</body>
          </ownedComment>
