            <body>Source: ah5-core-java-spring/serviceorchestration-dynamic/documentation/v5.3.0/DynamicServiceOrchestration-v5.3.0-generalManagement-HTTP-IDD.tex; The service is registered in the ServiceRegistry with the interface template generic_https (generic_http when TLS is disabled), access port 8441 and base path /serviceorchestration/general/mgmt. The operations property of the interface lists the operations below with their method and path relative to the base path (path parameters are placeholders such as \texttt{{id}} that the consumer fills in):

\noindent\begin{longtable}{| p{5.2cm} | p{1.6cm} | p{8.4cm} |} \hline
