            <body>Source: ah5-core-java-spring/serviceorchestration-simple/documentation/v5.3.0/SimpleStoreServiceOrchestration-v5.3.0-generalManagement-HTTP-IDD.tex; The service is registered in the ServiceRegistry with the interface template generic_https (generic_http when TLS is disabled), access port 8442 and base path /serviceorchestration/general/mgmt. The operations property of the interface lists the operations below with their method and path relative to the base path (path parameters are placeholders such as \texttt{{id}} that the consumer fills in):

