            <body>This document describes the AIGym support system of the Eclipse Arrowhead framework (documentation edition 5.3.0), as implemented in ah5-AIGym-java-spring of the primary Java source tree (Eclipse-Arrowhead-java) and deployed with the standalone Compose definition of that folder.
