        <packagedElement xmi:id="_ah53_b8262cc1cb5ec8cdb86f739c" name="aiGym_SD" xmi:type="uml:Class" />
        <packagedElement xmi:id="_ah53_062bbaed82fc302a5c5bc462" name="aiGym_HTTP_IDD" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <generalization xmi:id="_ah53_ae2b7f76487aab6e4b0d71c2" general="_ah53_b8262cc1cb5ec8cdb86f739c" xmi:type="uml:Generalization" />
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_ah53_40e9e531bb235a309646bd2c" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>Source: ah5-AIGym-java-spring/documentation/v5.3.0/AIGym-v5.3.0-aiGym-HTTP-IDD.tex; The service is registered in the ServiceRegistry with the interface template generic_https, policy CERT_AUTH, access address aigym, port 8478 and base path /aigym. The operations property of the interface lists the operations below with their method and path relative to the base path (path parameters are placeholders such as \texttt{{id}} that the consumer fills in):

\noindent\begin{longtable}{| p{5.2cm} | p{1.6cm} | p{8.4cm} |} \hline
\rowcolor{gray!33} Operation &amp; Method &amp; Path \\ \hline \endhead
status &amp; GET &amp; /status \\ \hline
add-sample &amp; POST &amp; /samples \\ \hline
predict &amp; POST &amp; /predict \\ \hline
observations &amp; GET &amp; /observations \\ \hline
\end{longtable}

\newpage</body>
          </ownedComment>
