        <packagedElement xmi:id="_ah53_72b58ab421331029e606831b" name="choreographerSession_SD" xmi:type="uml:Class" />
        <packagedElement xmi:id="_ah53_9bea9fea3d5b3376e34a56e5" name="choreographerSession_HTTP_IDD" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <generalization xmi:id="_ah53_9e1829dc1a15fae6aff46a61" general="_ah53_72b58ab421331029e606831b" xmi:type="uml:Generalization" />
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_ah53_c719bb86a5ae1ac4ce3dc60c" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>Source: ah5-Choreographer-java-spring/documentation/v5.3.0/Choreographer-v5.3.0-choreographerSession-HTTP-IDD.tex; The service is registered in the ServiceRegistry with the interface template generic_https, policy CERT_AUTH, access address choreographer, port 8457 (server.port; the standalone deployment registers 8454) and base path /choreographer/session. The operations property of the interface lists the operations below with their method and path relative to the base path (path parameters are placeholders such as \texttt{{id}} that the consumer fills in):

\noindent\begin{longtable}{| p{5.2cm} | p{1.6cm} | p{8.4cm} |} \hline
\rowcolor{gray!33} Operation &amp; Method &amp; Path \\ \hline \endhead
start-session &amp; POST &amp; /start \\ \hline
abort-session &amp; DELETE &amp; \texttt{/abort/{id}} \\ \hline
\end{longtable}

\newpage</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <ownedOperation xmi:id="_ah53_6e041872d14d18f95b9c4576" name="start-session" xmi:type="uml:Operation">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_ah53_4c7253868a1abcbeb8299dd4" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <body>{"protocol": "http", "method": "POST", "address": "/choreographer/session/start", "source": "ah5-Choreographer-java-spring/src/main/java/eu/arrowhead/choreographer/api/http/SessionAPI.java", "query": [], "path": [], "status": []}</body>
            </ownedComment>
