            <body>Source: ah5-Choreographer-java-spring/documentation/v5.3.0/Choreographer-v5.3.0-choreographerManagement-HTTP-IDD.tex; The service is registered in the ServiceRegistry with the interface template generic_https, policy CERT_AUTH, access address choreographer, port 8457 (server.port; the standalone deployment registers 8454) and base path /choreographer/mgmt. The operations property of the interface lists the operations below with their method and path relative to the base path (path parameters are placeholders such as \texttt{{id}} that the consumer fills in):

\noindent\begin{longtable}{| p{5.2cm} | p{1.6cm} | p{8.4cm} |} \hline
\rowcolor{gray!33} Operation &amp; Method &amp; Path \\ \hline \endhead
query-plans &amp; GET &amp; /plans \\ \hline
get-plan &amp; GET &amp; \texttt{/plans/{id}} \\ \hline
create-plan &amp; POST &amp; /plans \\ \hline
remove-plan &amp; DELETE &amp; \texttt{/plans/{id}} \\ \hline
