            <body>Source: ah5-EventHandler-java-spring/documentation/v5.3.0/EventHandler-v5.3.0-eventPublish-HTTP-IDD.tex; The service is registered in the ServiceRegistry with the interface template generic_https, policy CERT_AUTH, access address eventhandler, port 8455 and base path /eventhandler/event-publish. The operations property of the interface lists the operations below with their method and path relative to the base path (path parameters are placeholders such as \texttt{{id}} that the consumer fills in):

\noindent\begin{longtable}{| p{5.2cm} | p{1.6cm} | p{8.4cm} |} \hline
\rowcolor{gray!33} Operation &amp; Method &amp; Path \\ \hline \endhead
publish &amp; POST &amp; /publish \\ \hline
\end{longtable}

\newpage</body>
