        <packagedElement xmi:id="_ah53_7b6ce939f15f3865df4bac55" name="generalManagement_SD" xmi:type="uml:Class" />
        <packagedElement xmi:id="_ah53_88688f3089caec60f4a40d0c" name="generalManagement_HTTP_IDD" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <generalization xmi:id="_ah53_0a335288fd9159e5866c5c9f" general="_ah53_7b6ce939f15f3865df4bac55" xmi:type="uml:Generalization" />
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_ah53_4e5f2851e60af7d056245075" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>Source: ah5-EventHandler-java-spring/documentation/v5.3.0/EventHandler-v5.3.0-generalManagement-HTTP-IDD.tex; The service is registered in the ServiceRegistry with the interface template generic_https, policy CERT_AUTH, access address eventhandler, port 8455 and base path /eventhandler/general/mgmt. The operations property of the interface lists the operations below with their method and path relative to the base path (path parameters are placeholders such as \texttt{{id}} that the consumer fills in):

\noindent\begin{longtable}{| p{5.2cm} | p{1.6cm} | p{8.4cm} |} \hline
\rowcolor{gray!33} Operation &amp; Method &amp; Path \\ \hline \endhead
get-log &amp; POST &amp; /logs \\ \hline
get-config &amp; GET &amp; /get-config \\ \hline
\end{longtable}

\newpage</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <ownedOperation xmi:id="_ah53_446d3e8e0d21befd3ff0da06" name="get-log" xmi:type="uml:Operation">
