            <body>Source: ah5-Gatekeeper-java-spring/documentation/v5.3.0/Gatekeeper-v5.3.0-gatekeeperManagement-HTTP-IDD.tex; The service is registered in the ServiceRegistry with the interface template generic_https, policy CERT_AUTH, access address gatekeeper, port 8449 and base path /gatekeeper. The operations property of the interface lists the operations below with their method and path relative to the base path (path parameters are placeholders such as \texttt{{id}} that the consumer fills in):

\noindent\begin{longtable}{| p{5.2cm} | p{1.6cm} | p{8.4cm} |} \hline
\rowcolor{gray!33} Operation &amp; Method &amp; Path \\ \hline \endhead
clouds &amp; GET &amp; /mgmt/clouds \\ \hline
relays &amp; GET &amp; /mgmt/relays \\ \hline
status &amp; GET &amp; /mgmt/status \\ \hline
\end{longtable}

\newpage</body>
          </ownedComment>
