            <body>This document describes the GraphDBManager support system of the Eclipse Arrowhead framework (documentation edition 5.3.0), as implemented in ah5-GraphDBManager-java-spring of the primary Java source tree (Eclipse-Arrowhead-java) and deployed with the standalone Compose definition of that folder.
  \end{abstract} Version 5.3.0; default port 8467; source ah5-GraphDBManager-java-spring/documentation/v5.3.0/GraphDBManager-v5.3.0-SysD.tex</body>
