          <generalization xmi:id="_ah53_a87dddf8509d48332ef08f86" general="_ah53_9a5bba2ed21e0b6e9ab8f00a" xmi:type="uml:Generalization" />
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_ah53_c6856301a6161c5995fae245" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>Source: ah5-Onboarding-java-spring/documentation/v5.3.0/Onboarding-v5.3.0-onboarding-HTTP-IDD.tex; The service is registered in the ServiceRegistry with the interface template generic_https, policy CERT_AUTH, access address onboarding, port 8435 and base path /onboarding. The operations property of the interface lists the operations below with their method and path relative to the base path (path parameters are placeholders such as \texttt{{id}} that the consumer fills in):

\noindent\begin{longtable}{| p{5.2cm} | p{1.6cm} | p{8.4cm} |} \hline
\rowcolor{gray!33} Operation &amp; Method &amp; Path \\ \hline \endhead
onboard-with-name &amp; POST &amp; /certificate/name \\ \hline
onboard-with-csr &amp; POST &amp; /certificate/csr \\ \hline
onboard-device &amp; POST &amp; /device \\ \hline
onboard-system &amp; POST &amp; /system \\ \hline
offboard-device &amp; POST &amp; /device/offboard \\ \hline
\end{longtable}

\newpage</body>
          </ownedComment>
