            <body>Source: ah5-Onboarding-java-spring/documentation/v5.3.0/Onboarding-v5.3.0-onboardingManagement-HTTP-IDD.tex; The service is registered in the ServiceRegistry with the interface template generic_https, policy CERT_AUTH, access address onboarding, port 8435 and base path /onboarding/mgmt. The operations property of the interface lists the operations below with their method and path relative to the base path (path parameters are placeholders such as \texttt{{id}} that the consumer fills in):

\noindent\begin{longtable}{| p{5.2cm} | p{1.6cm} | p{8.4cm} |} \hline
\rowcolor{gray!33} Operation &amp; Method &amp; Path \\ \hline \endhead
query-enrollments &amp; GET &amp; /enrollments \\ \hline
get-enrollment &amp; GET &amp; \texttt{/enrollments/{deviceName}} \\ \hline
approve-device &amp; PUT &amp; \texttt{/enrollments/{deviceName}} \\ \hline
offboard-device &amp; POST &amp; \texttt{/enrollments/{deviceName}/offboard} \\ \hline
remove-enrollment &amp; DELETE &amp; \texttt{/enrollments/{deviceName}} \\ \hline
\end{longtable}

\newpage</body>
