        <packagedElement xmi:id="_ah53_1abcd36a105ff254a3036827" name="generalManagement_SD" xmi:type="uml:Class" />
        <packagedElement xmi:id="_ah53_60b74ccdaab7443176404af1" name="generalManagement_HTTP_IDD" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <generalization xmi:id="_ah53_f40e39c3ec2752ef84cd7c29" general="_ah53_1abcd36a105ff254a3036827" xmi:type="uml:Generalization" />
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_ah53_fd626091c2dbaacf24afee89" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>Source: ah5-Onboarding-java-spring/documentation/v5.3.0/Onboarding-v5.3.0-generalManagement-HTTP-IDD.tex; The service is registered in the ServiceRegistry with the interface template generic_https, policy CERT_AUTH, access address onboarding, port 8435 and base path /onboarding/general/mgmt. The operations property of the interface lists the operations below with their method and path relative to the base path (path parameters are placeholders such as \texttt{{id}} that the consumer fills in):

\noindent\begin{longtable}{| p{5.2cm} | p{1.6cm} | p{8.4cm} |} \hline
\rowcolor{gray!33} Operation &amp; Method &amp; Path \\ \hline \endhead
get-log &amp; POST &amp; /logs \\ \hline
get-config &amp; GET &amp; /get-config \\ \hline
\end{longtable}

\newpage</body>
          </ownedComment>
