        <packagedElement xmi:id="_ah53_3963e9511dbc248edb19ccc3" name="plantDescriptionManagement_HTTP_IDD" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <generalization xmi:id="_ah53_29fcaaa331c3d43e96061ff2" general="_ah53_fead02cef375c2809c570209" xmi:type="uml:Generalization" />
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_ah53_0b1e9655eb59e6faeaa5f256" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>Source: ah5-PlantDescriptionEngine-java-spring/documentation/v5.3.0/PlantDescriptionEngine-v5.3.0-plantDescriptionManagement-HTTP-IDD.tex; The service is registered in the ServiceRegistry with the interface template generic_https, policy CERT_AUTH, access address plantdescriptionengine, port 8432 and base path /plantdescriptionengine/mgmt. The operations property of the interface lists the operations below with their method and path relative to the base path (path parameters are placeholders such as \texttt{{id}} that the consumer fills in):

\noindent\begin{longtable}{| p{5.2cm} | p{1.6cm} | p{8.4cm} |} \hline
\rowcolor{gray!33} Operation &amp; Method &amp; Path \\ \hline \endhead
query &amp; GET &amp; /plant-descriptions \\ \hline
get &amp; GET &amp; \texttt{/plant-descriptions/{id}} \\ \hline
create &amp; POST &amp; /plant-descriptions \\ \hline
replace &amp; PUT &amp; \texttt{/plant-descriptions/{id}} \\ \hline
update &amp; PATCH &amp; \texttt{/plant-descriptions/{id}} \\ \hline
remove &amp; DELETE &amp; \texttt{/plant-descriptions/{id}} \\ \hline
\end{longtable}

\newpage</body>
          </ownedComment>
