        <packagedElement xmi:id="_ah53_5202fdecd800d82eff5ad128" name="SoLocalCloudConfigurator_SysD" isAbstract="false" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_ah53_dd8879ca6cf9f83a59121141" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>Arrowhead 5.3 support system for **Systems of LocalClouds (SoLC)**: several local clouds, each built from a local-cloud
design stored in LocalCloudConfigurator, federated through an organisation relay, with the inter-cloud service exchanges
between them. It replaces the console's former SoS view and absorbs SoSConfigurator's policy engine and inter-cloud
planner (SoSConfigurator stays as legacy). Version 5.3.0; default port 8496; source ah5-SoLocalCloudConfigurator-java/README.md</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_ah53_175f6295ae758061c5eb3563" name="generalManagement_SD" type="_ah53_acb5cb165bb95929fda12a27" isService="true" aggregation="composite" xmi:type="uml:Port" />
