          <ownedComment xmi:id="_ah53_0e3f32f9755c09d1dfb160ed" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>Source: ah5-SysMonitor-java-spring/documentation/v5.3.0/SysMonitor-v5.3.0-sysMonitorManagement-HTTP-IDD.tex; The service is registered in the ServiceRegistry with the interface template generic_https, policy CERT_AUTH, access address sysmonitor, port 8475 and base path /sysmonitor/management. The operations property of the interface lists the operations below with their method and path relative to the base path (path parameters are placeholders such as \texttt{{id}} that the consumer fills in):

\noindent\begin{longtable}{| p{5.2cm} | p{1.6cm} | p{8.4cm} |} \hline
\rowcolor{gray!33} Operation &amp; Method &amp; Path \\ \hline \endhead
status &amp; GET &amp; /status \\ \hline
providers &amp; GET &amp; /providers \\ \hline
subscriptions &amp; GET &amp; /subscriptions \\ \hline
subscribe &amp; PUT &amp; \texttt{/subscriptions/{providerSystem}} \\ \hline
unsubscribe &amp; DELETE &amp; \texttt{/subscriptions/{providerSystem}} \\ \hline
reconcile &amp; POST &amp; /reconcile \\ \hline
\end{longtable}

\newpage</body>
          </ownedComment>
